commit 8a590711ce1eaeb8d4680a7cba2817bb8e50925b

C03: a task with only a date asks for its title; an unnamed alarm cancellation asks which alarm (AGENDA1337)

TIME1199 left «crea una tarea para el viernes» open: the model invented a title instead of asking. effect_intent now reads a task creation that carries at most a date as an explicit clarification of the title (task.create, title). AGENDA1021 left «cancelá la alarma» open: the clarification asked when to cancel because its missing field was named alarm_time; the owner rules that the product asks which alarm, so the field is which_alarm.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


